# Local secrets for `npm run dev`. Copy to `.dev.vars`, which is gitignored.
#
# The filing assistant calls OpenAI from the Cloudflare Worker
# (worker/assistant.ts), so the key never reaches the browser. Without it the
# assistant reports itself unavailable and every other part of the prototype
# works unchanged.
#
# For a deployed build, set the same value as a Worker secret instead:
#   npx wrangler secret put OPENAI_API_KEY

OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...
# Optional. Defaults to gpt-4.1-mini.
# OPENAI_MODEL=gpt-4.1-mini
